-- Backfill existing FoodData Central catalog IDs from the USDA releases:
-- Foundation Foods 2026-10-29 JSON and SR Legacy 2018-04 CSV.
-- https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/
-- Nutrient 1093 is sodium (mg). 2000 and 1063 are reported total sugars (g).
-- Prefer 2000 when both are present. Missing measurements stay null.

